## 1. Feature Overview

### 1.1 Purpose
Protect the Book Reading Log platform from inappropriate, harmful, or explicit content uploaded through the book import feature. Ensure all imported books, covers, and metadata are safe for all users.

### 1.2 Scope
This PRD covers content moderation for:
- File uploads (PDF, DOCX, TXT, CSV)
- Embedded images within imported files
- Text content (descriptions, titles, notes)
- Book cover image uploads

### 1.3 Design Principle
**"Reject early, explain clearly, log everything."** — Block bad content at the first checkpoint, tell the user exactly why, and keep records for admin review.

---

## 2. User Stories

| ID | Story | Priority |
|----|-------|----------|
| US-MOD-01 | As an admin, I want inappropriate file uploads blocked so the platform stays safe. | Must Have |
| US-MOD-02 | As a user, I want clear error messages when my import is rejected so I understand what went wrong. | Must Have |
| US-MOD-03 | As an admin, I want all moderation actions logged so I can review and adjust filters. | Must Have |
| US-MOD-04 | As a user, I want my legitimate book imports to never be falsely blocked so the system is reliable. | Should Have |
| US-MOD-05 | As an admin, I want to customize blocked keywords without redeploying so moderation stays current. | Could Have |

