## 4. Non-Functional Requirements

| ID | Requirement | Target |
|----|-------------|--------|
| NFR-MOD-01 | File validation speed | < 100ms |
| NFR-MOD-02 | Text extraction + scan | < 500ms for files < 5MB |
| NFR-MOD-03 | Image scan (Google Vision) | < 2s per image |
| NFR-MOD-04 | Total import processing | < 5s end-to-end |
| NFR-MOD-05 | False positive rate | < 2% (legitimate imports blocked) |
| NFR-MOD-06 | Uptime | Moderation system must not block imports if scan services fail |
| NFR-MOD-07 | Privacy | Never store user file content, only metadata and scan results |

