### 6.2 API Integrations

#### Google Vision API SafeSearch (Free Tier)
- **Endpoint:** `https://vision.googleapis.com/v1/images:annotate`
- **Free quota:** 1,000 requests/month
- **What it detects:** Adult, violence, racy, spoof content
- **Key required:** Google Cloud Console → Enable Vision API → Create API Key

#### Google Gemini API (Optional AI Moderation)
- **Model:** `gemini-1.5-flash`
- **Free quota:** 60 requests/minute
- **Used for:** Secondary text analysis when keyword scan is inconclusive
- **Key required:** Google AI Studio

### 6.3 Database Schema Addition

```prisma
// Add to my-app/prisma/schema.prisma

model ImportLog {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId    String
  fileName  String
  fileType  String
  fileSize  Int      // in bytes
  status    String   // "success", "rejected", "error"
  reason    String?  // rejection reason
  category  String?  // "file_type", "size", "text", "image", "rate_limit"
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  
  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  
  @@index([userId])
  @@index([status])
  @@index([createdAt])
}
```

### 6.4 Data Flow

```
User uploads file
│
├─→ 1. FILE VALIDATOR
│   ├─→ Check file type (magic numbers)
│   ├─→ Check file size (< 10MB)
│   └─→ FAIL → Log rejection, return error
│
├─→ 2. RATE LIMITER
│   ├─→ Check imports/hour for user
│   └─→ FAIL → Log rejection, return error
│
├─→ 3. TEXT SCANNER
│   ├─→ Extract text from PDF/DOCX/TXT/CSV
│   ├─→ Scan against blocked keywords
│   ├─→ Sanitize HTML/JS
│   └─→ FAIL → Log rejection, return error
│
├─→ 4. IMAGE SCANNER (if applicable)
│   ├─→ Extract images from PDF/DOCX
│   ├─→ Send to Google Vision SafeSearch
│   └─→ FAIL → Log rejection, return error
│
├─→ 5. AI MODERATION (optional)
│   ├─→ Send text to Gemini for secondary scan
│   └─→ FAIL → Log rejection, return error
│
├─→ 6. PARSE & SAVE
│   ├─→ Parse structured book data
│   ├─→ Save to database
│   └─→ Log success
│
└─→ Return success to user
```

