## 10. Error Handling & Edge Cases

| Scenario | Handling |
|----------|----------|
| File type spoofing (renamed .exe to .pdf) | Check magic numbers, not just extension |
| Corrupted PDF/DOCX | Catch extraction error, return "Unable to read file" |
| Google Vision API down | Skip image scan, flag for review, allow import |
| Gemini API down | Skip AI moderation, rely on keyword scan only |
| Rate limiter down | Allow import (fail open for UX) |
| Zero-byte file | Reject as "Invalid file" |
| Password-protected PDF | Reject as "Unable to read file" |

