## 11. Acceptance Criteria

**AC-MOD-01:** Given a user uploads a PDF with explicit text, when the import runs, the file is rejected and the user sees a clear error message.

**AC-MOD-02:** Given a user uploads a DOCX with an inappropriate embedded image, when the import runs, the file is rejected before any book data is saved.

**AC-MOD-03:** Given a user uploads 6 files in one hour, when the 6th import runs, it is rejected with a rate limit message.

**AC-MOD-04:** Given Google Vision API is unavailable, when a user imports a file with images, the import proceeds with a flag for manual review.

**AC-MOD-05:** Given a user uploads a valid, clean PDF, when the import runs, all moderation checks pass and books are saved successfully.

**AC-MOD-06:** Given any import attempt, when processed, a log entry is created with user ID, file name, status, and timestamp.

