## 13. Notes for Developer

- **Fail gracefully:** If any scan service is down, don't block imports — log and flag for review
- **Performance:** Run file validation and rate limiting BEFORE expensive text/image scans
- **Privacy:** Don't store file contents, only metadata and scan results
- **Testing:** Create a test suite with clean files, explicit files, edge cases
- **Configurability:** Make blocked keyword list easy to update (JSON file or database table)
- **Logging:** Always log rejections — helps tune false positives over time

